\" href=\"/\">TRYSCENT</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"lp55-cart\" aria-label=\"Cart\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 7h12l-1.2 12H7.2L6 7zm3 0a3 3 0 0 1 6 0\"></path></svg>Cart</button></div><div class=\"ts-lp55 ts-lp55-first\"><section class=\"hero\"><div class=\"hero-bg\"></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"hero-copy\"><h1>The right scent <em>rekindles the spark.</em></h1><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#fragrances\">Discover the right one</a><div class=\"trustline\"><span class=\"stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> Over 10,000 fragrance lovers have chosen Magyx</div><div class=\"proofline\"><span>Inspired by iconic luxury perfumes</span><span>Long-lasting scent</span><span>Made in Europe</span><span>IFRA-approved</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section emotion\"><div class=\"wrap emotion-grid\"><div class=\"emotion-image\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Elegant woman applying perfume\"></div><div class=\"emotion-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">The final detail</p><h2>Most perfumes smell wonderful.</h2><div class=\"lead\">A few make you feel <span>irresistible again.</span><br>We know exactly which ones they are.</div><p class=\"body\">Because the same perfumes are mentioned again and again by customers who wanted to feel just like you. The right perfume isn't just another beauty product. It's the final detail that completes your look and <strong>reminds you what it feels like to be seen again.</strong></p></div></div></section><section class=\"section problem\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Why some scents make a bigger impression</p><h2>Why do some scents get compliments...</h2><p>...while others fade before you've even made it out the door?</p></div><div class=\"problem-grid\"><article class=\"problem-card\"><div class=\"num\">01</div><h3>Too little perfume oil</h3><p>Thinner formulations can contain as little as 5&#8211;15% fragrance concentration. That can mean weaker projection and a scent that disappears before the evening has even started.</p></article><article class=\"problem-card\"><div class=\"num\">02</div><h3>Too much perfume oil</h3><p>Some intense perfumes can contain 40% fragrance concentration or more. Without the right balance, the scent can feel heavy and overwhelming instead of pleasant and inviting.</p></article><article class=\"problem-card\"><div class=\"num\">03</div><h3>Cheaper ingredients</h3><p>Low-quality ingredients, or ones the skin doesn't tolerate well, can cause irritation, redness and rashes and give some people headaches.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section difference\" id=\"difference\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"difference-intro\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">What sets Magyx apart from the crowd</p><h2>Perfumes created to <span>spark curiosity.</span></h2></div><div><p>Magyx's scents are created by the same perfume experts behind some of the world's best-known perfumes.</p><p>The same quality and longevity you expect from the big brands?</p><div class=\"answer\">We've got that.</div></div></div><p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">Premium, inside and out</p><div class=\"feature-grid\"><div class=\"feature\"><div class=\"feature-mark\">21</div><h3>21%+ perfume oil</h3><p>True perfume strength for a noticeable scent with a long-lasting effect.</p></div><div class=\"feature\"><div class=\"feature-mark\">EU</div><h3>Made in Europe</h3><p>Made to high European quality standards.</p></div><div class=\"feature\"><div class=\"feature-mark\">&#10003;</div><h3>IFRA guidelines</h3><p>Meets the world's leading safety standards for perfumes.</p></div><div class=\"feature\"><div class=\"feature-mark\">0</div><h3>Clean Label</h3><p>No phthalates or parabens. (Remember: redness, irritation, headaches?) Fully transparent ingredient lists that are kinder to the skin.</p></div><div class=\"feature\"><div class=\"feature-mark\">V</div><h3>Vegan and cruelty-free</h3><p>Made without animal ingredients and without animal testing.</p></div></div></div></section></div>",
