      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"ts-lp55\"><section class=\"section icons\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"icon-lead\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Timeless icons</p><h2>Some scents don't follow trends.<span>They leave a timeless impression.</span></h2><p>The scents women have loved for generations.</p></div><div class=\"icon-grid\"><article class=\"icon-card\"><img class=\"icon-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/lp55_img_10.jpg?v=1785087067\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Inspired by Chanel Coco Mademoiselle\"><h3>Inspired by Chanel Coco Mademoiselle</h3><p>Refined. Feminine. Naturally elegant.</p><div class=\"buy\"><strong class=\"price\">175 kr</strong><button type=\"button\" class=\"add lp55-atc\" data-variant-id=\"44660170260550\" data-handle=\"magic-perfume-no-139w\">Add to cart</button></div></article><article class=\"icon-card\"><img class=\"icon-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/lp55_img_11.jpg?v=1785087067\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Inspired by Chanel No. 5\"><h3>Inspired by Chanel No. 5</h3><p>Iconic. Sophisticated. Timeless.</p><div class=\"buy\"><strong class=\"price\">175 kr</strong><button type=\"button\" class=\"add lp55-atc\" data-variant-id=\"44660162232390\" data-handle=\"magic-perfume-no-077w\">Add to cart</button></div></article><article class=\"icon-card\"><img class=\"icon-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/lp55_img_12.jpg?v=1785087067\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Inspired by Dior J&#8217;adore\"><h3>Inspired by Dior J&#8217;adore</h3><p>Radiant. Elegant. Unforgettable.</p><div class=\"buy\"><strong class=\"price\">175 kr</strong><button type=\"button\" class=\"add lp55-atc\" data-variant-id=\"44660170063942\" data-handle=\"magic-perfume-no-159w\">Add to cart</button></div></article></div><p class=\"icons-note\">These are the scents women return to when they want to feel elegant, seen and completely themselves.</p></div></section><section class=\"section reviews\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Don't just take our word for it</p><h2>Why customers love these scents</h2><p>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4.9/5 &#8212; Women looking for the same feeling loved these scents.</p></div><div class=\"review-grid\"><article class=\"quote-card\"><div class=\"stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><blockquote>&#8220;The scent is incredibly creamy, powdery and very elegant. It smells luxurious and gets tons of compliments.&#8221;</blockquote><cite>Dorota</cite></article><article class=\"quote-card\"><div class=\"stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><blockquote>&#8220;The scent lasts much longer than I expected. I've already had several compliments when wearing it.&#8221;</blockquote><cite>Alina Maier</cite></article><article class=\"quote-card\"><div class=\"stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><blockquote>&#8220;Incredibly fresh, elegant and feminine, and surprisingly close to exclusive perfumes.&#8221;</blockquote><cite>Lulu</cite></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section paying\"><div class=\"wrap pay-grid\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">What you're really paying for</p><h2>You pay for the scent.</h2></div><div class=\"pay-copy\"><p>Every Magyx fragrance is inspired by some of the world's most iconic luxury perfumes. Created by the same perfume experts behind some of the world's best-known perfumes.</p><p>Made with the quality and performance people expect from a premium fragrance. The difference is in what you don't have to pay for.</p><div class=\"not-paying\"><span>The designer brand</span><span>The celebrity campaigns</span><span>The luxury packaging</span><span>The retail markups</span></div><p>So paying less doesn't mean getting less.</p><div class=\"final\">You pay for the scent.<br><em>Instead of the logo on the bottle.</em></div></div></div></section><section class=\"offer\"><div class=\"wrap offer-inner\"><h2>The spark never went away.</h2><p class=\"intensity\">Sometimes two &#8220;sprays&#8221; are all it takes to bring the feeling back.</p><p>You've seen what works. Now it's your turn. Order today and get a free full-size Mystery Fragrance. So you can discover yet another new favorite.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#fragrances\">Find the right one</a></div></section><section class=\"section faq\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Questions and answers</p><h2>Everything you need to know</h2></div><div class=\"faq-list\"><div class=\"faq-item open\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"faq-q\">How long do the scents last?<span>+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><p>Our perfumes contain 21%+ perfume oil and give the long-lasting scent people expect from premium perfumes.</p></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"faq-q\">Why are they so much cheaper?<span>+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><p>You pay for the scent itself. Not for the designer brand, the celebrity campaigns, the luxury packaging or everything else that drives up the price.</p></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"faq-q\">Are they safe to use?<span>+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><p>Yes. Our scents are made in Europe, IFRA-approved and have a Clean Label formulation without phthalates or parabens. All ingredients are openly disclosed.</p></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"faq-q\">What if I don't like the scent?<span>+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><p>You're covered by our 60-day money-back guarantee, so you can try it without worrying.</p></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"faq-q\">Which scent should I choose?<span>+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><p>Start with the recommendations on this page. They're based on thousands of customer experiences from women who wanted more compliments, renewed confidence and scents that leave a lasting impression.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section membership\" id=\"membership\"><div class=\"wrap member-grid\"><div class=\"member-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Signature Membership</p><h2>You don't wear the same clothes for every occasion. <span>Why wear the same perfume?</span></h2><ul class=\"benefits\"><li>Personal fragrance recommendations</li><li>Member-exclusive launches and offers</li><li>Seasonal favorites picked for you</li><li>Exclusive member prices</li><li>2 bottles per month</li></ul><div class=\"member-price\">149 kr<small>/month &#183; Limited number of new spots every month</small></div></div><div><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">01</div><div><h3>Register your interest</h3><p>We'll let you know when a spot in the Signature Membership becomes available.</p></div></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">02</div><div><h3>If you're offered a spot</h3><p>You'll get your first personal Signature recommendation and a welcome gift as a member.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"member-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#lp55-optin\">Apply for the Signature Membership</a></div><div id=\"lp55-optin\"><form class=\"optin-form\" method=\"post\" action=\"/contact#lp55-optin\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_type\" value=\"customer\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"utf8\" value=\"&#10003;\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"return_to\" value=\"\" class=\"lp55-return-to\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"contact[tags]\" value=\"newsletter,LP55\"><input type=\"email\" name=\"contact[email]\" required autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter your email\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Join the list</button></form><p class=\"lp55-optin-ok\" hidden>Thanks! You're on the list.</p></div></div></div></section>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var SECTIONS='cart-drawer,cart-icon-bubble';\n  function drawerEl(){return document.querySelector('cart-drawer');}\n  function closeDrawer(d){\n    if(typeof d.close==='function'){d.close();}\n    else{d.classList.remove('active');document.body.classList.remove('overflow-hidden');}\n  }\n  function applySections(sec){\n    var d=drawerEl();\n    if(!d)return false;\n    if(typeof d.renderContents==='function'){\n      try{d.renderContents({sections:sec});return true;}catch(err){}\n    }\n    if(!sec||!sec['cart-drawer'])return false;\n    var t=document.createElement('div');t.innerHTML=sec['cart-drawer'];\n    var inner=t.querySelector('cart-drawer');\n    if(!inner)return false;\n    d.innerHTML=inner.innerHTML;\n    d.className=inner.className;\n    var ov=d.querySelector('#CartDrawer-Overlay');\n    if(ov)ov.addEventListener('click',function(){closeDrawer(d);});\n    if(typeof d.open==='function'){d.open();}\n    else{d.classList.add('animate','active');document.body.classList.add('overflow-hidden');}\n    return true;\n  }\n  function fetchAndOpen(){\n    fetch('/?sections='+SECTIONS)\n      .then(function(r){return r.json()})\n      .then(function(sec){if(!applySections(sec))window.location.href='/cart';})\n      .catch(function(){window.location.href='/cart';});\n  }\n  document.addEventListener('click',function(e){\n    var cartBtn=e.target.closest('.lp55-cart');\n    if(cartBtn){e.preventDefault();fetchAndOpen();return;}\n    var arrow=e.target.closest('.lp55-slide');\n    if(arrow){\n      var row=document.getElementById('lp55ProductRow');\n      if(row)row.scrollBy({left:parseInt(arrow.getAttribute('data-dir'),10)*(row.clientWidth*0.72),behavior:'smooth'});\n      return;\n    }\n    var fq=e.target.closest('.faq-q');\n    if(fq){fq.parentElement.classList.toggle('open');return;}\n    var btn=e.target.closest('.lp55-atc');\n    if(!btn)return;\n    e.preventDefault();\n    var vid=btn.getAttribute('data-variant-id');\n    var orig=btn.innerHTML;\n    btn.disabled=true;btn.innerHTML='Adding...';\n    fetch('/cart/add.js',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},\n      body:JSON.stringify({items:[{id:parseInt(vid,10),quantity:1}],sections:SECTIONS,sections_url:window.location.pathname})})\n      .then(function(r){if(!r.ok)throw new Error('add failed');return r.json()})\n      .then(function(data){\n        btn.innerHTML='Tillagd \\u2713';\n        if(!applySections(data&&data.sections))fetchAndOpen();\n        setTimeout(function(){btn.innerHTML=orig;btn.disabled=false;},1500);\n      })\n      .catch(function(){\n        btn.disabled=false;btn.innerHTML=orig;\n        window.location.href='/products/'+btn.getAttribute('data-handle');\n      });\n  });\n  var rt=document.querySelector('.lp55-return-to');\n  if(rt)rt.value=window.location.pathname+'?customer_posted=true#lp55-optin';\n  if(/[?&]customer_posted=true/.test(window.location.search)){\n    var box=document.getElementById('lp55-optin');\n    if(box){\n      var f=box.querySelector('form');if(f)f.hidden=true;\n      var ok=box.querySelector('.lp55-optin-ok');if(ok)ok.hidden=false;\n      box.scrollIntoView({block:'center'});\n    }\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n\n</div>",
